```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
  participant C as Client
  participant A as API (Express)
  participant E as Engine Core
  participant D as Docker

  C->>A: POST /evaluate (challengeId, submission.zip)
  A->>E: evaluateJob(challengeId, buffer)
  E->>E: extractZip() -> /tmp/eval/<jobId>/workspace
  E->>E: preflightValidate()
  E->>D: docker run (mount workspace, tests, runner)
  D-->>E: logs + JSON result line
  E->>E: normalizeResult()
  E-->>A: result JSON
  A-->>C: 200 OK + result JSON
```

## Notes

- The runner resolves dependencies via `NODE_PATH`:
  - `/app/node_modules` (runner deps: jest, supertest)
  - `/deps/<challengeId>/node_modules` (challenge runtime deps)
- Hidden tests are copied into `/workspace/challenge/tests` so relative imports like `../../src/app` work.
